WEBVTT

00:16:56.386 --> 00:17:01.183
create an environment at home
where they have the opportunity

00:17:01.224 --> 00:17:04.394
and multiple occasions
to challenge their beliefs

00:17:04.436 --> 00:17:07.481
about what's possible within them,

00:17:07.522 --> 00:17:09.483
to step outside of their comfort zone,

00:17:09.524 --> 00:17:10.692
to take risks,

00:17:10.734 --> 00:17:15.238
to learn from failure,
to bounce back from rejection,

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:17.949
then the sooner we'll put them on the path

00:17:17.949 --> 00:17:20.035
of living out their potential

00:17:20.035 --> 00:17:23.205
to lead very fulfilling
and successful lives.

00:17:23.663 --> 00:17:24.873
Thank you.

00:17:24.915 --> 00:17:28.335
(Applause)